  "title": "Chocolate Lovers Fettuccine a la Mode",
  "description": "This luscious and romantic dessert tops chilled chocolate fettuccine pasta with chocolate whipped cream, vanilla ice cream, and a drizzle of chocolate for the perfect end to a perfect dinner.",
  "authors": [
    "sweetlittlejean"
  ],
